{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24815","headline":"赋得浊水求珠 · 王损之","name":"赋得浊水求珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积水非澄彻，明珠不易求。\n依稀沈极浦，想像在中流。\n瞪目思清浅，褰裳恨暗投。\n徒看川色媚，空爱夜光浮。\n月入疑龙吐，星归似蚌游。\n终希识珍者，采掇冀冥搜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王损之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}